  "description": "OEDRO floor liners are compatible with the 2023-2026 Chevy Colorado & GMC Canyon Crew Cab. They provide an excellent rugged and durable grip. Absolutely no slipping. The TPE tri-extruded composition ensures 100% safe, 100% odorless, and environmentally friendly in all weather (rain, fog, snow, etc).\nFeatures\nDurability. One of the best things about OEDRO floor mats is that they are developed with strong rubber. This gives them longevity in comparison to other styles of mats. The floor mats are quite flexible. The heavy-duty material is also capable of withstanding constant rubbing and contacting of shoes.\nExcellent Visual Appearance. Adding an all-weather floor liner to your car’s interior will add color and class to your car. The mat’s unique appearance will accentuate the interior look of your car tenfold.\nProtecting the Interior. OEDRO Floor mats offer vehicles perhaps the most comprehensive interior protection in comparison to any other car mat. Your car’s carpet will remain clean and dry at all times.\nCleaning these Mats is Quite Easy. The materials used for creating floor mats are elementary to wash and clean. You can easily wash and clean the spillage on top of it. You can also spray it using soap and water. Also, there won’t be any odor remaining once the mat dries out.\nIt Traps Dirt and Moisture. The waterproof surface of all-weather floor mats makes sure to trap any kind of spillage on top it. The mats can also trap dust, sand, and other dry particles effectively.\n2-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2023-2026 Chevy Colorado Crew Cab\nCompatible with 2023-2026 GMC Canyon Crew Cab.\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring.",
  "highlights": [
    "All-weather protection system with deep channels and raised edges that trap mud, snow, and spills, keeping your floor clean, dry, and fully protected year-round.",
    "Made from eco-friendly TPE material that is odorless, durable, and flexible, offering long-lasting performance while remaining safe for family use and extreme temperatures.",
    "Waterproof surface allows quick rinse or wipe cleaning, while anti-slip texture and secure fit system keep mats stable and firmly in place during daily driving."
  ],
